# Demo-video build output — regenerable via video/run_pipeline.py (see
# video/README.md). The final MP4 is force-added despite living in this
# ignored dir; everything else here (narration mp3s, slide pngs, per-beat
# terminal mp4s and frame dumps) rebuilds deterministically from the
# committed video/casts/*.cast files.
video/output/

